            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638930/extras/9e6dbcaf487d0d36264e7a7d4ab214ed.avif?t=1788744030\" alt=\"What Is True Happiness? True Paradise?\" width=780 height=414 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this romantic, slice-of-life visual novel, you take the role of a transfer student newly admitted to Kazana Academy, a school set on an island created to be an everlasting summer paradise. Yet something seems off with the Paradise System run by the AI girl you meet on your first day.<br><br>As you attend classes and grow closer to your classmates, you'll learn more about their personal stories, find love and friendships, and uncover what each girl really needs to find true happiness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638930/extras/956b8028bce029809ab9d8fc92c0633a.avif?t=1788744030\" alt=\"Key Features\" width=780 height=350 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638930/extras/bc8c5180a7601f07a1ba7ccfa780192a.avif?t=1788744030\" alt=\"A Gorgeous Island Paradise\" width=780 height=414 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This story takes place on Kazana Island, an island created to be an everlasting summer paradise, with sparkling beaches, perfect weather, and everything the residents could need.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638930/extras/a5ebaed4c1812d91df41723a229f58f6.avif?t=1788744030\" alt=\"Multiple Branching Paths\" width=780 height=546 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will lead you down many paths, including each heroine's story and one unlockable ending.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638930/extras/52e3f0f9421873be34d1a426f310db64.avif?t=1788744030\" alt=\"Cute Girls To Date\" width=780 height=341 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a sweet, wholesome, and cute romance with one of the five main heroines:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638930/extras/628b1eeca6b500ec970bdfaaa8c84593.avif?t=1788744030\" alt=\"Himari - The Energetic Free-Spirit\" width=780 height=331 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638930/extras/daf1c0f88d5fb043a1d68ce6b0ff7456.avif?t=1788744030\" alt=\"Hazuki - The Aloof Council President\" width=780 height=331 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638930/extras/19f9ff69b29e729127c54a683d110ddf.avif?t=1788744030\" alt=\"Io - The Pretty Girl Living In Her Own Fantasy\" width=780 height=331 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638930/extras/3d1b8ff67cb21efec184efc2ae4ad0f4.avif?t=1788744030\" alt=\"Noeri - The Caring Cousin\" width=780 height=331 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638930/extras/7561de43c9a0067c4af0d414a0fda978.avif?t=1788744030\" alt=\"Ame - The AI Responsible For Everyone&#039;s Happiness\" width=780 height=331 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638930/extras/cd598eb0bed26849a29af3a4794f8b1b.avif?t=1788744030\" alt=\"Full Voice Acting\" width=780 height=414 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aside from the protagonist, every character is voiced by exceptional talent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638930/extras/f2c19a286cfeec9f98d3e6d5cc7bffe6.poster.avif?t=1788744030\" aria-label=\"A Hint Of Sci-Fi And Mystery\" width=780 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638930/extras/f2c19a286cfeec9f98d3e6d5cc7bffe6.webm?t=1788744030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638930/extras/f2c19a286cfeec9f98d3e6d5cc7bffe6.mp4?t=1788744030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The paradise of Kazana Island is maintained by an AI-governed system, but when you begin seeing the happiness rating assigned to everyone, it becomes clear the system isn't quite so perfect...</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638930/extras/9e6dbcaf487d0d36264e7a7d4ab214ed.avif?t=1788744030\" alt=\"What Is True Happiness? True Paradise?\" width=780 height=414 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this romantic, slice-of-life visual novel, you take the role of a transfer student newly admitted to Kazana Academy, a school set on an island created to be an everlasting summer paradise. Yet something seems off with the Paradise System run by the AI girl you meet on your first day.<br><br>As you attend classes and grow closer to your classmates, you'll learn more about their personal stories, find love and friendships, and uncover what each girl really needs to find true happiness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638930/extras/956b8028bce029809ab9d8fc92c0633a.avif?t=1788744030\" alt=\"Key Features\" width=780 height=350 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638930/extras/bc8c5180a7601f07a1ba7ccfa780192a.avif?t=1788744030\" alt=\"A Gorgeous Island Paradise\" width=780 height=414 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This story takes place on Kazana Island, an island created to be an everlasting summer paradise, with sparkling beaches, perfect weather, and everything the residents could need.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638930/extras/a5ebaed4c1812d91df41723a229f58f6.avif?t=1788744030\" alt=\"Multiple Branching Paths\" width=780 height=546 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will lead you down many paths, including each heroine's story and one unlockable ending.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638930/extras/52e3f0f9421873be34d1a426f310db64.avif?t=1788744030\" alt=\"Cute Girls To Date\" width=780 height=341 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a sweet, wholesome, and cute romance with one of the five main heroines:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638930/extras/628b1eeca6b500ec970bdfaaa8c84593.avif?t=1788744030\" alt=\"Himari - The Energetic Free-Spirit\" width=780 height=331 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638930/extras/daf1c0f88d5fb043a1d68ce6b0ff7456.avif?t=1788744030\" alt=\"Hazuki - The Aloof Council President\" width=780 height=331 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638930/extras/19f9ff69b29e729127c54a683d110ddf.avif?t=1788744030\" alt=\"Io - The Pretty Girl Living In Her Own Fantasy\" width=780 height=331 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638930/extras/3d1b8ff67cb21efec184efc2ae4ad0f4.avif?t=1788744030\" alt=\"Noeri - The Caring Cousin\" width=780 height=331 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/638930/extras/7561de43c9a0067c4af0d414a0fda978.avif?t=1788744030\" alt=\"Ame - The AI Responsible For Everyone&#039;s Happiness\" width=780 height=331 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com